      "rev_n_5_490f2d_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_5_490f2d_1",
        "node_id": "n_5_490f2d",
        "thought_text": "I apologize for the oversight. The error in the code is in the final check for impossibility. Instead of checking if the earliest arrival at station N is less than 1800 seconds, we should check if it's less than 1800 seconds of the earliest arrival at station 1. This is because the question asks for the earliest time to book a train from station 1, not from station N. Let's modify this part of the code to correct the logic.",
